   "resumo_en": "Feral Roots is the sixth studio album by American rock band Rival Sons. It was released on January 25, 2019, through Low Country Sound and Atlantic Records. It is the band's first album since Hollow Bones (2016), and their first release on Atlantic Records. It was preceded by the lead single \"Do Your Worst\", which peaked at number one on the Billboard Mainstream Rock Songs chart in March 2019."
